    pixel-`L∞` perturbation of size ≤ 8/255 leaves class 0 the strict argmax of
    the conv net — conv, max-pool and a dense head, four layers. -/
theorem cert10e8 : CertifiedAtLinf3 net ((8:ℝ)/255) img10 0 := by
  refine ibp3_certified_of_boxSound net_boxSound ?_
  intro j hj
  simp only [netLo, netHi, (box10e8).1, (box10e8).2,
    (pool10e8).1, (pool10e8).2]
